    "detailed_description": "The dark lord has returned, unleashing his horde of monsters on humanity. You must wield the legendary sword and defeat evil, once and for all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760640/extras/645dc6c3ec14f026861c61d5c3c90e15.poster.avif?t=1740765058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760640/extras/645dc6c3ec14f026861c61d5c3c90e15.webm?t=1740765058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760640/extras/645dc6c3ec14f026861c61d5c3c90e15.mp4?t=1740765058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Retro 80s graphics with some modern flair<br></li><li>Deliberate gameplay and controls for an oldschool challenge<br></li><li>Catchy chiptune soundtrack and sfx<br></li><li>5 unique sub weapons to pick up on your journey<br></li><li>6 intense stages that will have you fighting to the next checkpoint<br></li><li>Unlock <strong>Expert Mode</strong> for new enemies, areas, and more surprises!<br></li><li><strong>Casual Mode</strong>, for those who prefer unlimited lives and extra checkpoints<br></li><li><strong>Speedrun Modes</strong> for the full game and individual stages</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The dark lord has returned, unleashing his horde of monsters on humanity. You must wield the legendary sword and defeat evil, once and for all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760640/extras/645dc6c3ec14f026861c61d5c3c90e15.poster.avif?t=1740765058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760640/extras/645dc6c3ec14f026861c61d5c3c90e15.webm?t=1740765058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760640/extras/645dc6c3ec14f026861c61d5c3c90e15.mp4?t=1740765058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Retro 80s graphics with some modern flair<br></li><li>Deliberate gameplay and controls for an oldschool challenge<br></li><li>Catchy chiptune soundtrack and sfx<br></li><li>5 unique sub weapons to pick up on your journey<br></li><li>6 intense stages that will have you fighting to the next checkpoint<br></li><li>Unlock <strong>Expert Mode</strong> for new enemies, areas, and more surprises!<br></li><li><strong>Casual Mode</strong>, for those who prefer unlimited lives and extra checkpoints<br></li><li><strong>Speedrun Modes</strong> for the full game and individual stages</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Awakened Evil is an action platformer inspired by the classics. Jump and slash your way through intense linear stages that will put your skills to the test. Do you have what it takes to slay all the bosses, and take on evil itself?",
